; STR8-BANK0-AP-SMOKE.A
; ARCHIVED 2026-08-09: COMPLETED BANKED-AP PROMOTION FIXTURE.
; WHY IT WAS HERE: IT SUPPLIED THE PINNED MOVABLE AP USED TO PROVE AP B0.
; WHY IT MOVED: RAM AND BANK-0 EXECUTION ARE HARDWARE-ACCEPTED; KEEP THIS
; EXACT PACKAGE INPUT FOR REGRESSION CHECKS, NOT AS AN OPERATOR PROGRAM.
; TINY MOVABLE AP FOR THE SPLIT-V1 BANK-0 LOAD/RUN PROMOTION GATE.
;
; BUILD UNDER BANK-3 HIMON/ASM-F2:
;   ASM NEW
;   PASTE THIS SOURCE
;   SEAL> PACKAGE $4000
;   SEAL> .
;   AP $4000 $3000
;
; REQUIRE THE RAM AP RUN TO PASS BEFORE FLASH INSTALLATION. INSTALL THAT
; ENVELOPE WITH STR8-BANK-MAINT-2000.A COMMAND P.
; THAT FIXED PATH STORES IT AT BANK 0 $BF00 ONLY WHEN THE ENTIRE TARGET
; RANGE IS ERASED. THEN RUN:
;   AP B0 $BF00 $3000
;   D 5848 5850
;
; PASS: GO $3000, RET A=$AC WITH C SET, $5848=$AC, AND $5850=$5A.

        ORG $2000

MAIN    STZ $5848
        ENTRY MAIN
        LDA #$5A
        STA $5850
        LDA #$AC
        STA $5848
        SEC
        RTS

        END
